{"4441950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aliens Took My Stuff", "steam_appid": 4441950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4814360], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP SIM ABOUT ALIEN THIEVES </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re aliens on a mission to steal human stuff and harvest its DNA. Grab everything from couches to toothbrushes and safely beam it up to your UFO. Use the collected DNA to upgrade your ship and unlock better gear for even bigger heists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/939d5f71a6442ecc600aa61cb521c3b3.poster.avif?t=1787037903\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/939d5f71a6442ecc600aa61cb521c3b3.webm?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/939d5f71a6442ecc600aa61cb521c3b3.mp4?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting too close to humans is a terrible idea, so stealth is your best option. Sneak through rooms carefully to secure the loot without waking up everyone in the neighborhood. If they spot you... you’ll quickly learn why Earthlings are so scary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/e24b9298995238b8827c83f2d1df1377.poster.avif?t=1787037903\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/e24b9298995238b8827c83f2d1df1377.webm?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/e24b9298995238b8827c83f2d1df1377.mp4?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALIEN POWERS AND GADGETS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use advanced alien tech to find items with the highest DNA. Lift furniture with telekinesis or turn invisible to walk right past danger. Or, you know, just kidnap one poor fella to scan him on your ship. You’re an alien, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/0bbd26854813d4ac1be7909c2fc16611.poster.avif?t=1787037903\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/0bbd26854813d4ac1be7909c2fc16611.webm?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/0bbd26854813d4ac1be7909c2fc16611.mp4?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE ANGRY EARTHLINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans are paranoid and will try to stop you with hidden traps, security cameras, and locked doors. You better watch your step! If you mess up, prepare to drop everything and run from angry locals armed with baseball bats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/7320e562dc3a1094c6ff30acc9b84f71.poster.avif?t=1787037903\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/7320e562dc3a1094c6ff30acc9b84f71.webm?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/7320e562dc3a1094c6ff30acc9b84f71.mp4?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP SIM ABOUT ALIEN THIEVES </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re aliens on a mission to steal human stuff and harvest its DNA. Grab everything from couches to toothbrushes and safely beam it up to your UFO. Use the collected DNA to upgrade your ship and unlock better gear for even bigger heists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/939d5f71a6442ecc600aa61cb521c3b3.poster.avif?t=1787037903\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/939d5f71a6442ecc600aa61cb521c3b3.webm?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/939d5f71a6442ecc600aa61cb521c3b3.mp4?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting too close to humans is a terrible idea, so stealth is your best option. Sneak through rooms carefully to secure the loot without waking up everyone in the neighborhood. If they spot you... you’ll quickly learn why Earthlings are so scary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/e24b9298995238b8827c83f2d1df1377.poster.avif?t=1787037903\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/e24b9298995238b8827c83f2d1df1377.webm?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/e24b9298995238b8827c83f2d1df1377.mp4?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALIEN POWERS AND GADGETS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use advanced alien tech to find items with the highest DNA. Lift furniture with telekinesis or turn invisible to walk right past danger. Or, you know, just kidnap one poor fella to scan him on your ship. You’re an alien, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/0bbd26854813d4ac1be7909c2fc16611.poster.avif?t=1787037903\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/0bbd26854813d4ac1be7909c2fc16611.webm?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/0bbd26854813d4ac1be7909c2fc16611.mp4?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE ANGRY EARTHLINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans are paranoid and will try to stop you with hidden traps, security cameras, and locked doors. You better watch your step! If you mess up, prepare to drop everything and run from angry locals armed with baseball bats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/7320e562dc3a1094c6ff30acc9b84f71.poster.avif?t=1787037903\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/7320e562dc3a1094c6ff30acc9b84f71.webm?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/extras/7320e562dc3a1094c6ff30acc9b84f71.mp4?t=1787037903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "In this 1-4 player co-op simulator, you are aliens stealing people's personal belongings straight from their homes to study their DNA. Use telekinesis, turn invisible, and deploy advanced sci-fi gadgets to rob houses clean. Just avoid getting caught by angry Earthlings!", "supported_languages": "English, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/b6dd53b0519add2851781a2f577027eaf56f4fac/header.jpg?t=1787037903", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/81ef983f8d2ebdb674a9baa1ff9497deb3928c0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787037903", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4441950/81ef983f8d2ebdb674a9baa1ff9497deb3928c0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787037903", "website": "https://linktr.ee/redcoregames", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Red Core Games"], "publishers": ["Polden Publishing", "Red Core Games"], "package_groups": [], "platf